            >
              <span class='correct-word'>GOODIES</span>
              <span class='correct-word'>GOODIES</span>
              <span class='correct-word'>GOODIES</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class='word-group'>
            <div class='word-group__title'>8:</div><div
